WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,420
Immediately book your seat according to the seat on the ticket

2
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:08,060
Guest, I will personally take you to your seat

3
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:12,620
Good dogs don’t wait

4
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:15,260
Newcomer, I remember you

5
00:00:15,260 --> 00:00:18,620
Give your name to Su Chen to remember

6
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:21,650
You will be killed by the owner of this name

7
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:25,500
Su Chen, I'm waiting

8
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:27,500
Even if you can't do it directly

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:28,500
I want to kill you

10
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,500
I have plenty of means

11
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:34,900
It turns out his name is Su Chen

12
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:46,720
distinguished guest

13
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:48,780
this is your seat

14
00:00:58,810 --> 00:01:00,810
Fighting between passengers is prohibited

15
00:01:00,810 --> 00:01:01,810
You can't move me
